	measure 'delta_moy._moisture' = ```
			
			      (AVERAGE(delta_moisture_realized_recommended[delta_percent_steep_c2_moisture]) + AVERAGE(delta_moisture_realized_recommended[delta_percent_pregerm_moisture]) + AVERAGE(delta_moisture_realized_recommended[delta_percent_kiln_load_moisture])) / 3
			```
